  "description": {
   "en": "\"Wait, why the hell am I kissing this guy right now?!!\"\n\nThe story is set in a certain magic school.\nEve, a dog beastfolk, is excited about the \"Buddy Selection Ceremony\". The moment his Buddy is announced, everyone is in an uproar.\n\nThat is because his Buddy is none other than \"Aura\", a genius wolf beastfolk who has some dark rumors surrounding him! (Just who is this guy?!)\n\nEven so, Eve approaches him to try and become friends with him, but Eve coldly rejects him with an \"I don't have the energy to talk to you\"! He's harsh and their magics are the polar opposites of each other, so they couldn't be a worse match...\n\nCan you really live together with someone like that...?!\n\nA fluffy, chaotic Buddy BL!!\nMysterious Lone Wolf x Cheerful Puppy!!"
  },
